    "# NHS HEALTHCARE APPOINTMENT UTILISATION & CAPACITY ANALYSIS"
   ]
  },
  {
   "attachments": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0834b036",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Background\n",
    "NHS England has a problem. A problem of limited capacity and resource utilisation\n",
    "Or does it?\n",
    "Missed appointments cost  £30 each, a financial and social burden\n",
    "15M missed GP appointments. This is a signficant cost to the tax payer. Is there any way to reduce the instances of missed appointments. How has Covid affected the NHS and it's operations?\n",
    "\n",
    "The NHS have posed two questions:\n",
    "Has there been adequate staff & capacity in the networks?\n",
    "What was the actual utilisation of resources?"
   ]
  },
