    "range from 220 - 280 million monthly appointments. The other service settings are impossible to read off of the same graph so a new graph was plotted for thoise service settings excluding GP appointmmnets.\n",
    "\n",
    "Extended Access Provision ranged from 200,000 to 250,000\n",
