  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6ce37a2b-e549-44c7-9590-74262c6cd2f3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "But wait a minute. The data states there is a cpacity of 1.2m every single day, includiong weekends. We know this can't be the case as GPs tend to be closed and indeed the nymber of appopintments at a weekend is a lot less than on weekdays.\n",
    "Due to less appointments at weekends but retaining the 1.2m capacity figure distorts the utilisation figure' Looks like there is more availability than there actaully is. This is a limitation of the data\n",
    "So the data needs to be considered for Monday - Friday only usinmg the 1.2 million capacity.\n",
    "Also Tuesday appears to be the buiest day in terms of appointment count. But what about bank holidays. Indeed christmass and easter bank holidays, new years day etc. Again the figures are distorted\n",
    "What services are operating at weekends?\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
