   "source": [
    "This plot shows a dramatic decrease in face to face appointments at March 2020 (lockdown). At the sane time a smaller increase in telephone appointments occured. The numbers of telephone appointments continued at similar levels throughout the period whereas face to face saw two peaks. February 2021 saw a snall increase in both appointment modes. This was repeated in March 2022 but not so pronounced "
   ]
